notes.content:
Hey folks! 

Last week we making our best to improve our game based on the received feedback! 

Our game has the next big updates:

- Upgrade project to Unreal Engine 5 and enabled Lumen;

- Redesigned Shooter Mechanic with new Procedural Animations;

- Updated Level Design;

- Updated Inspiration Mechanic from Inventory;

And you can try it!

When and where? Well, you will have the chance to touch the beauty of Demo on the Game Gathering Conference 2023 at 5-6 August which will take the place in Kyiv!
